// ============================================================
// Facts (L5) — a class a query may reach two ways
// ============================================================
// reporting::TradeFact is mapped AggregationAware: the same class is backed by the DETAIL
// table and by a pre-aggregated one, and the engine chooses based on the query's shape.
// A groupBy whose keys and aggregates match the declared view reads the small table; a
// row-level projection reads the detail.
###Pure
Class reporting::TradeFact
{
    bookId: String[1];
    notional: Float[1];
}
